<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="wrap hero-inner"><div><div class="eyebrow">Student portfolio · Manila, Philippines</div><h1 id="heroName">Pia Gianne M. Portento</h1><p class="hero-subtitle" id="heroCourse">BS Information Technology Student</p><p class="hero-focus">Mobile and Web Applications ／ <span id="heroYear">3rd Year</span></p><p class="hero-copy">I’m learning to turn ideas into useful mobile and web experiences. This is where I share what I’m studying, building, and enjoying along the way.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#projects">View My Work <span></span></a><a class="button outline" href="#about">About Me</a></div></div><aside class="profile-card"><div class="profile-top"><span>Personal portfolio</span><b>2026</b></div><div class="avatar-wrap" aria-hidden="true"><span class="avatar">PG</span></div><div class="profile-caption"><h2 id="profileName">Pia Gianne M. Portento</h2><p>Curious mind · hands-on learner</p></div><div class="profile-divider"></div><div class="profile-meta"><span><i class="status-dot"></i><strong id="heroStatus">Currently Enrolled</strong></span><span id="heroSection">INF246</span></div><div class="hero-note">learning by making ✦</div></aside></div></section>
